cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AlienBody: The Gap Between Action Knowledge and Control in LLM Agents"
message: "If you use this software / benchmark, please cite the camera-ready paper once available."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous authors"
    affiliation: "Under peer review"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnonymousPubCode/ICLR27-AlienBody"
abstract: >-
  AlienBody is a diagnostic benchmark for action knowledge and control in LLM agents:
  anonymous action IDs, a calibrate-then-plan protocol, and an interface ladder
  that separates exploration, interpretation, and planning failures.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - action grounding
  - anonymous actions
  - diagnostic benchmark
